        <p begin="00:00:00.000" end="00:00:05.040" tts:direction="ltr">So for this units concept and context
<br />lesson,</p>
        <p begin="00:00:05.040" end="00:00:11.080" tts:direction="ltr">again, my goal for these aren't to
<br />reiterate what's going on in the textbook.</p>
        <p begin="00:00:11.080" end="00:00:13.680" tts:direction="ltr">This is not a substitution for the
<br />textbook.</p>
        <p begin="00:00:13.680" end="00:00:16.240" tts:direction="ltr">Rather, what this is trying to do is</p>
        <p begin="00:00:16.240" end="00:00:19.080" tts:direction="ltr">to take a step back and look at the bigger
<br />picture.</p>
        <p begin="00:00:19.080" end="00:00:21.880" tts:direction="ltr">This is really trying to answer the so
<br />what?</p>
        <p begin="00:00:21.880" end="00:00:23.915" tts:direction="ltr">Why should I care?</p>
